00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:25.040
Ready!

00:16:38.550 --> 00:16:40.730
Work hard! Work hard!

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:41.720
Good job!

00:16:42.010 --> 00:16:45.820
Hey, don’t walk! Aren’t you third graders?

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:48.130
Aren’t you ashamed of first graders passing you?

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:50.250
I can’t keep up with young people!

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:51.750
I’ll try!

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:05.620
Yup!

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:12.200
Keep it up, keep it up!

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:16.740
Here they are! Ichimura-kun isn’t first?

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:20.720
We won’t lose by the name of the Hell Boy Corps!

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:22.480
Yes!

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:24.130
It’s over!

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:29.440
This is Earth’s truth!

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:37.360
Ichimura?

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:38.690
That woman?

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:45.240
You say, “How beautiful!” and it’s an instant kill!

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:50.430
Even if it’s old, if you say it’s on the cutting edge, she’ll buy it for double the price!

00:17:50.430 --> 00:17:53.400
Wives like her have so much time and money!

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:58.320
What? Not at all! With a hag like that!

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:15.550
Are you OK?

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:17.610
Yes.

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:20.100
I’m going to rest for a while.

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:21.990
Akie, go on without me.

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:22.820
But…

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:25.910
I’m OK; I’ll chase you in a bit.

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:28.880
Got it. Sorry. See you later!

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:37.830
Oh, this is progress!

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:40.080
Really?

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:43.340
Only you can pull this design off.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:45.530
Quite beautiful.

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:50.880
What a loving child!

00:18:54.970 --> 00:18:56.460
Kazuya-kun!

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:03.650
Ma’am, it’s really quite beautiful!

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:05.150
How rude!

00:19:06.090 --> 00:19:07.400
Am I that beautiful?

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:09.850
Yes, very beautiful.

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:17.020
Your grudge is received.

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:05.640
Where is this?

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:06.920
Ma’am? Ma’am?

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:08.940
Hey, you!

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:13.210
Am I beautiful?

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:20.240
Am I beautiful?

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:23.090
It really suits you well, Hime.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.390
Am I beautiful?

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:34.620
Only you can pull this design off.

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:38.140
S-Stop this!

00:20:38.140 --> 00:20:40.040
What are you accusing me for?!

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:43.910
Taking advantage of a woman’s heart; isn’t that a malicious sales technique?

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:49.870
I was accompanying that lonely lady! She was enjoying it!

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:50.900
What’s wrong with that?!

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:05.340
O pitiful shadow, wandering in darkness.

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:08.400
Degrading and scarring people.

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:11.180
The ball of sin drowned in sin.

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:15.190
Do you want to die this once?

00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:19.180
I did nothing wrong.

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:21.490
She was the only one that bought them happily!

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:22.300
Hey!

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:29.270
Stop it! Let go!

00:21:29.270 --> 00:21:33.590
What are you doing? I have to go to my next job!

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:38.670
Ojou-chan I just received a good kimono!

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:41.330
Much better than the one you have now!

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:43.210
I’ll even make it cheaper for you!

00:21:41.510 --> 00:21:45.860
This hatred will ferry you to Hell.

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:47.940
It will absolutely suit you well! Ojou-chan, you’ll almost…

00:22:02.930 --> 00:22:06.690
Wasn’t the marathon disappointing?

00:22:06.690 --> 00:22:11.010
I’m sorry, I suddenly felt sick.

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:12.250
What are you reading?

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:16.200
It’s where I’ll go eventually.

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:23.770
Sensei, what do women like to hear most?

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:27.300
How beautiful, ma’am!

00:22:27.650 --> 00:22:28.490
Really?

00:22:30.140 --> 00:22:31.920
I wonder…

00:22:31.920 --> 00:22:35.280
Excuse me, my father’s here to pick me up.

00:22:44.600 --> 00:22:49.860
Note: Candle says, Ichimura Kazuya.

00:22:44.600 --> 00:22:49.860
I will release your hatred.

