What would I be happy about if not this? Nothing!

00:24:28.080 --> 00:24:31.880
It’s a serial murder case, based off of novels!

00:24:31.880 --> 00:24:37.550
Because of that, they came to a crossroads in their lives, and…

00:24:37.550 --> 00:24:42.080
So many customers! Your grudge is received!

00:24:43.610 --> 00:24:46.030
Hime! Stop that!

